ted and necessary. Remove or replace with documented APIs. Ensure no secrets, tokens, or PII are transmitted.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"E1","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":13,"tags":["Data Exfiltration"]},{"category":"Excessive Agency","code_snippet":"\nA local development token for a linked Vercel project can access that same project's Preview deployments by default. It does not automatically access protected Production deployments. For protected Production, the project's own Trusted Sources entry must allow `development` → `production`.\n\nDo not ask the user to configure Trusted Sources for the normal same-project Preview case.\n\nConfiguration is needed when:\n","confidence":0.8,"evidence":{},"finding":"Do not ask the user","finding_ids":["finding-b3c409e738954f28a73457f73790343b"],"id":"sha256:8e16cd9c06c40e5066c9861bb2e5fd702c6c2a1440fce538aa01ec09d645663d","intent":null,"line":139,"match_fingerprint":"53c32905e950cbdc0f915b81bab4262cf87077e93ee69f468581a690049d9c76","message":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-b3c409e738954f28a73457f73790343b","line":139,"path":"SKILL.md","start_column":0}],"path":"SKILL.md","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"EA2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":0,"tags":["Excessive Agency"]}],"findings_truncated":false,"freshness":"historical","id":"vercel/vercel-plugin/access-protected-vercel-deployment","kind":"standalone_skill","plugin_path":null,"profile":{"digest":"sha256:a73e7c4a9fa0ac563a885c541d207e90dde2e248ca426f7824cf429d725db921","id":"static-standard-v3"},"r